! This configuration is not modified by the python wrapper
! Any changes here are permanent!

T                  ! Do_Expcoeffs     Expansion coefficient output
T                  ! Do_Fmatrix       F-matrix output
F                  ! Do_LinearRef     Flag linearizing w.r.t REF parameters
F                  ! Do_LinearPSD     Flag linearizing w.r.t PSD parameters
4, 4, 4            ! psd_indexes      Kind of distribution to use. 4 is lognormal.
F, F, F            ! FixR1R2          Flag for fixing R1 & R2 internally (PSDs 1,2,3)
20.0, 20.0, 20.0   ! R1R2_cutoff      Cutoff for fixing R1 & R2 internally (PSDs 1,2,3)
10, 10, 10         ! nblocks          number of PSD quadrature blocks  (PSDs 1,2,3)
20, 20, 20         ! nweights         number of PSD quadrature weights (PSDs 1,2,3)
10000.0            ! xparticle_limit   Particle size limit
181                ! n_Fmatrix_angles  number of F matrix angles for output


